(7196792, 1107605, 163430, '<td valign="top">- I like the matte reflection in the water and the motion blur on the clouds.<br/>- I don''t like the centered horizon<br/>- I''m still looking for a giant inflatable pig between the chimmneys :-)</td>', '- I like the matte reflection in the water and the motion blur on the clouds.- I don''t like the centered horizon- I''m still looking for a giant inflatable pig between the chimmneys :-)', '2014-04-01 05:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196793, 1107509, 67258, '<td valign="top">A slight rotation anti-clockwise would help, I feel. Always interesting looking into the mouths of orchids. I wonder if a reflector (I use a piece of cardboard covered in crumpled tin foil) would have helped give a bit of brightness and lift to the ''angel''?</td>', 'A slight rotation anti-clockwise would help, I feel. Always interesting looking into the mouths of orchids. I wonder if a reflector (I use a piece of cardboard covered in crumpled tin foil) would have helped give a bit of brightness and lift to the ''angel''?', '2014-04-01 05:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196794, 1107026, 67258, '<td valign="top">An amazing sky!</td>', 'An amazing sky!', '2014-04-01 05:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196795, 1105922, 67258, '<td valign="top">A super portrait, absolutely tack-sharp, good textural detail, and very effective against the oof background and foreground.  I wouldn''t want every wildlife photo I see to be like this, as generally I do like to get a stronger sense of context, but I do really like the other-worldly feel of this particular photograph.</td>', 'A super portrait, absolutely tack-sharp, good textural detail, and very effective against the oof background and foreground.  I wouldn''t want every wildlife photo I see to be like this, as generally I do like to get a stronger sense of context, but I do really like the other-worldly feel of this particular photograph.', '2014-04-01 05:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
