(7197373, 1106631, 170018, '<td valign="top">this other zebra''s posterior draws all attention with its fascinating pattern. :-) If you wanted to keep it in the frame may be it was worth naming the photo differently (something with the stripes, that are everywhere here :-)). Otherwise I would have cropped it, so we could also see this cute fluffy little one better. :-)<br/>Still a great photo, nice light!</td>', 'this other zebra''s posterior draws all attention with its fascinating pattern. :-) If you wanted to keep it in the frame may be it was worth naming the photo differently (something with the stripes, that are everywhere here :-)). Otherwise I would have cropped it, so we could also see this cute fluffy little one better. :-)Still a great photo, nice light!', '2014-04-02 01:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
