(7198909, 1107643, 111808, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this - it is poignant and a touch ghostly, like these hand crafted steeds are just waiting for the turn of the season to come back to life while they are imprisoned and one can just see their outlines through the bars. The bench overlay works well too as a reminder of the changes past and coming. Bravo, brilliantly crafted!</td>', 'I LOVE this - it is poignant and a touch ghostly, like these hand crafted steeds are just waiting for the turn of the season to come back to life while they are imprisoned and one can just see their outlines through the bars. The bench overlay works well too as a reminder of the changes past and coming. Bravo, brilliantly crafted!', '2014-04-04 20:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7198910, 1107652, 111808, '<td valign="top">The pink colours reflected in the rilles are gorgeous and the multiple level silky lines draw the eye in to and over the waterflow, gentle rise at first then more pronounced as it becomes faster and darker. All 3 parts are here - Strophe, Antistrophe, Epode.<br/>Beautiful.</td>', 'The pink colours reflected in the rilles are gorgeous and the multiple level silky lines draw the eye in to and over the waterflow, gentle rise at first then more pronounced as it becomes faster and darker. All 3 parts are here - Strophe, Antistrophe, Epode.Beautiful.', '2014-04-04 20:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7198979, 1107694, 94815, '<td valign="top">The bars don''t work especially the bottom one with the white line. So I cropped them out and found a beautiful image of an old beach pier. I would give a 6 or maybe even a 7 if possible to contemplate the quality without distracting elements (bars), but since the border is part of the image my vote is a 5.</td>', 'The bars don''t work especially the bottom one with the white line. So I cropped them out and found a beautiful image of an old beach pier. I would give a 6 or maybe even a 7 if possible to contemplate the quality without distracting elements (bars), but since the border is part of the image my vote is a 5.', '2014-04-04 23:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
