(7199369, 1107651, 114285, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary image!<br/> <br/>This one is so compelling, I can''t take my eyes off this image. I can only imagine how much those hands have felt and her eyes have seen in her lifetime.<br/> <br/>I haven''t handed out a verineat for a while, but I feel I have too with this amazing image. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1070026" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg"/></a> 10</td>', 'Extraordinary image! This one is so compelling, I can''t take my eyes off this image. I can only imagine how much those hands have felt and her eyes have seen in her lifetime. I haven''t handed out a verineat for a while, but I feel I have too with this amazing image.  10', '2014-04-06 02:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
