(7199903, 1107419, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wonderful motor-sport image. Perfect blur so slowish s/s of 1/160 or thereabouts. There aren''t enough of this genre at DPC. Love the lifting right rear wheel and naturally the backfire.</td>', 'Wonderful motor-sport image. Perfect blur so slowish s/s of 1/160 or thereabouts. There aren''t enough of this genre at DPC. Love the lifting right rear wheel and naturally the backfire.', '2014-04-07 02:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
