(7200092, 1107649, 114225, '<td valign="top">This image is amazing.</td>', 'This image is amazing.', '2014-04-07 10:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200101, 1107206, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! SANBI, Little Falls? :) They are nesting again! It''s a great shot but needs a little more crispness imo. That could be the downsize from 5000px to 800px and I can help you with an action for DPC :)</td>', 'Nicely done! SANBI, Little Falls? :) They are nesting again! It''s a great shot but needs a little more crispness imo. That could be the downsize from 5000px to 800px and I can help you with an action for DPC :)', '2014-04-07 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200130, 1105937, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  An intricate combination of subtle blues and greens, reflected patterns and psychological probing.  Stunning as both image and design.  Imposing and delicate.  Favorite in this challenge and beyond.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  An intricate combination of subtle blues and greens, reflected patterns and psychological probing.  Stunning as both image and design.  Imposing and delicate.  Favorite in this challenge and beyond.', '2014-04-07 12:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200137, 1107106, 173844, '<td valign="top">Man-made objects in landscapes can be problematic, but here they superbly complement an already beautiful, well, seascape.  What''s magical is that the boats appear to be afloat in the reflected sky, with the sea floor vegetation seeming to be atmospheric too.  Also well-illustrated is the rule of thirds.  While the image seems to be heavier on the left, the lines of the boats and posts gently lead the eye to the brighter orange horizon on the right, establishing an overall balance.  Fine stuff.</td>', 'Man-made objects in landscapes can be problematic, but here they superbly complement an already beautiful, well, seascape.  What''s magical is that the boats appear to be afloat in the reflected sky, with the sea floor vegetation seeming to be atmospheric too.  Also well-illustrated is the rule of thirds.  While the image seems to be heavier on the left, the lines of the boats and posts gently lead the eye to the brighter orange horizon on the right, establishing an overall balance.  Fine stuff.', '2014-04-07 13:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200208, 1107058, 173844, '<td valign="top">Artistic take on this elephant in the wild (or so it seems).  It''s endearing in its delicacy, light pouring over its body from behind.  Bold.  I only wish its underbelly and hind legs weren''t so dark, but I respect the totality of the photographer''s vision.  As a matter of fact, I''m broadening my own understanding of the elephant by seeing this, so thanks.</td>', 'Artistic take on this elephant in the wild (or so it seems).  It''s endearing in its delicacy, light pouring over its body from behind.  Bold.  I only wish its underbelly and hind legs weren''t so dark, but I respect the totality of the photographer''s vision.  As a matter of fact, I''m broadening my own understanding of the elephant by seeing this, so thanks.', '2014-04-07 15:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200210, 1107372, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful mirrored interior of mysterious humanity and unstated plot.  How this tight corner has burst open!  I find this quirky composition to be somehow sympathetic and balanced.  Very appealing.</td>', 'Wonderful mirrored interior of mysterious humanity and unstated plot.  How this tight corner has burst open!  I find this quirky composition to be somehow sympathetic and balanced.  Very appealing.', '2014-04-07 15:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200211, 1105047, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yep, it''s all about the light.  And the double rainbow.  It''s a perfectly caught moment of immanence and epiphany.  The choice of terrain and composition is excellent.</td>', 'Yep, it''s all about the light.  And the double rainbow.  It''s a perfectly caught moment of immanence and epiphany.  The choice of terrain and composition is excellent.', '2014-04-07 15:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200212, 1105048, 173844, '<td valign="top">Really fine portrait.  Every minimal detail in the face is beautifully seen and contributes to a truly expressive whole.  All that darkness to the right gives a feeling of forward movement.  So well done.</td>', 'Really fine portrait.  Every minimal detail in the face is beautifully seen and contributes to a truly expressive whole.  All that darkness to the right gives a feeling of forward movement.  So well done.', '2014-04-07 15:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200215, 1107649, 173844, '<td valign="top">A confection in steel and golden light. Beautifully modulated sky.  And, finally, graced with a pair of virtuosic pigeons dancing the buildings edge.  I really like it.</td>', 'A confection in steel and golden light. Beautifully modulated sky.  And, finally, graced with a pair of virtuosic pigeons dancing the buildings edge.  I really like it.', '2014-04-07 15:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200218, 1106259, 173844, '<td valign="top">A colossal, and beautiful, black and white landscape.  It bounds in scale from pines to mountains to clouds.  A mute statement of the world''s grandeur.  So stunning, words diminish its power.</td>', 'A colossal, and beautiful, black and white landscape.  It bounds in scale from pines to mountains to clouds.  A mute statement of the world''s grandeur.  So stunning, words diminish its power.', '2014-04-07 15:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200219, 1107495, 20799, '<td valign="top">Are the Russians coming?</td>', 'Are the Russians coming?', '2014-04-07 16:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200223, 1107239, 50695, '<td valign="top">the processing is a little overdone, draws attention to itself. the capture is good, though.</td>', 'the processing is a little overdone, draws attention to itself. the capture is good, though.', '2014-04-07 16:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200224, 1106874, 50695, '<td valign="top">the glow effect loses "grandma" in competing textures.</td>', 'the glow effect loses "grandma" in competing textures.', '2014-04-07 16:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200234, 1107239, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully expressive characters.  The entire scene is pitch perfect, from the people to the cinematic composition to the marvelous range of tonality.  It''s all so admirably done.</td>', 'Wonderfully expressive characters.  The entire scene is pitch perfect, from the people to the cinematic composition to the marvelous range of tonality.  It''s all so admirably done.', '2014-04-07 16:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200239, 1107669, 173844, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled, down to the rock shedding its sheath of snow in the foreground.  There''s a newborn freshness at play here, maybe because the trees are a bit furry and indistinct.  I like the way the river is situated, and how its banks seem to slide past one another.  Black and white is a great choice.</td>', 'Aptly titled, down to the rock shedding its sheath of snow in the foreground.  There''s a newborn freshness at play here, maybe because the trees are a bit furry and indistinct.  I like the way the river is situated, and how its banks seem to slide past one another.  Black and white is a great choice.', '2014-04-07 16:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200246, 1107348, 173844, '<td valign="top">Hard to resist a healthy, handsome pigeon, taking in the world with an adroit cocking of its head.   This is very becoming glimpse of a passing moment in a intimate and pretty bit of everyday space.  The colors are softly harmonious, with the pigeon''s iridescence blending right in.  There''s also a bonanza of lovingly presented textures.  The complete package.</td>', 'Hard to resist a healthy, handsome pigeon, taking in the world with an adroit cocking of its head.   This is very becoming glimpse of a passing moment in a intimate and pretty bit of everyday space.  The colors are softly harmonious, with the pigeon''s iridescence blending right in.  There''s also a bonanza of lovingly presented textures.  The complete package.', '2014-04-07 17:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200247, 1107390, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful glimpse of an alien world.  Sumptuous colors.</td>', 'Beautiful glimpse of an alien world.  Sumptuous colors.', '2014-04-07 17:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200249, 1107268, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely flowing dunes with surprising stands of bush and tree.  The shadows are so deftly interwoven with the sunlit flanks of sand.  My quirk, but I would prefer it without the person sitting there.</td>', 'Lovely flowing dunes with surprising stands of bush and tree.  The shadows are so deftly interwoven with the sunlit flanks of sand.  My quirk, but I would prefer it without the person sitting there.', '2014-04-07 17:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200252, 1106453, 173844, '<td valign="top">Magical spectral highlights transform a rather undramatic scene into a patch of beauty.  I almost expect to see Glinda (the good witch) float down in an enormous bubble.</td>', 'Magical spectral highlights transform a rather undramatic scene into a patch of beauty.  I almost expect to see Glinda (the good witch) float down in an enormous bubble.', '2014-04-07 17:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7200342, 1107569, 173844, '<td valign="top">This handsome canyon scene is all about, to me, the assembly of massive shapes into a solid composition, abetted by the use of color and texture.  Let it be said, though, that these massive shapes are beautifully detailed.</td>', 'This handsome canyon scene is all about, to me, the assembly of massive shapes into a solid composition, abetted by the use of color and texture.  Let it be said, though, that these massive shapes are beautifully detailed.', '2014-04-07 18:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
