(7200679, 1107474, 30364, '<td valign="top">I could have been - should have been - more generous with this than my 6.  Even though that did put it in my top ten.  I''m an admirer of good street stuff, and even pretend to be a street photographer myself, so there''s no excuse for my having failed to do you justice.<br/> <br/>What I''d have said had I been on the ball was that this photograph is a very contemporary take on a classic street image theme.  Like when they do productions of Shakespeare in modern street costume and Laertes says, "Yo!" to Ophelia.  Your photograph is clever, economical and pure.  <br/> <br/>But it''s too late to say all that now.  Just in time though, to say thank you.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-04-08 02:04:28.</i></td>', 'I could have been - should have been - more generous with this than my 6.  Even though that did put it in my top ten.  I''m an admirer of good street stuff, and even pretend to be a street photographer myself, so there''s no excuse for my having failed to do you justice. What I''d have said had I been on the ball was that this photograph is a very contemporary take on a classic street image theme.  Like when they do productions of Shakespeare in modern street costume and Laertes says, "Yo!" to Ophelia.  Your photograph is clever, economical and pure.   But it''s too late to say all that now.  Just in time though, to say thank you.', '2014-04-08 03:01:04.000000', '2014-04-08 03:04:28.000000', 0);
