(7201689, 1107682, 124190, '<td valign="top">This was taken at Middlecreek Wildlife Sanctuary during the annual migration of Tundra Swans and Snow Geese.   There were over 60,000 birds there the evening nikonjeb and I went over to take photos.   Incredible!</td>', 'This was taken at Middlecreek Wildlife Sanctuary during the annual migration of Tundra Swans and Snow Geese.   There were over 60,000 birds there the evening nikonjeb and I went over to take photos.   Incredible!', '2014-04-10 18:50:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7201848, 1107557, 124815, '<td valign="top">You took me back to some childhood memories even if you found all this on a different continent. After all, the world is small when it comes to neighborhood cats. Very tender image</td>', 'You took me back to some childhood memories even if you found all this on a different continent. After all, the world is small when it comes to neighborhood cats. Very tender image', '2014-04-11 02:44:08.000000', NULL, 0),
