(7202496, 1107572, 67145, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful Sandy .. this image warms my heart .. there is so much abuse going on in this world .. ppl and animals .. that i can hardly bear it .. when i hear of ppl like you and Stefanie with their love for the animals we share this world with it makes the sadness i feel for those that are treated badly less intense .. this is a wonderfully and emotive image .. you hardly need to be told that Homer is blind .. i feel quite emotional writing this .. thankyou for sharing . :)</td>', 'absolutely beautiful Sandy .. this image warms my heart .. there is so much abuse going on in this world .. ppl and animals .. that i can hardly bear it .. when i hear of ppl like you and Stefanie with their love for the animals we share this world with it makes the sadness i feel for those that are treated badly less intense .. this is a wonderfully and emotive image .. you hardly need to be told that Homer is blind .. i feel quite emotional writing this .. thankyou for sharing . :)', '2014-04-12 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 0),
